her","start":0.45,"text":{"en":"Welcome to Auto Maintenance, Book 1. This is Unit 3, Tools and Safe Working.","ar":"أهلاً بكم في صيانة السيارات، الكتاب الأوّل. هذه الوحدة الثالثة، العُدّة والعمل الآمن."},"id":"L001"},{"actor":"maher","start":7.4,"text":{"en":"This is Part 9, a Local Case Study. You will hear how a Damascus garage reached dealership standard, then decide yourself.","ar":"هذا الجزء التاسع، دراسة حالة محلّية. ستسمع كيف بلغت ورشة في دمشق معيار الوكالة، ثمّ تقرّر بنفسك."},"id":"L002"},{"actor":"maher","start":16.438,"text":{"en":"Before you read: what does a garage need to become an authorised service centre?","ar":"قبل أن تقرأ: ما تحتاجه الورشة لتصبح مركز خدمة معتمداً؟"},"id":"L003"},{"actor":"maher","start":21.804,"text":{"en":"I once visited a small garage in Damascus that wanted to become an authorised service centre.","ar":"زرتُ مرّة ورشة صغيرة في دمشق أرادت أن تصبح مركز خدمة معتمداً."},"id":"L004"},{"actor":"maher","start":27.89,"text":{"en":"The owner did good work, but the workshop was not safe enough for the dealership standard.","ar":"كان صاحبها يعمل عملاً جيّداً، لكن الورشة لم تكن آمنة بما يكفي لمعيار الوكالة."},"id":"L005"},{"actor":"maher","start":33.736,"text":{"en":"I gave simple advice. You do not need expensive machines first, I said. You need safety.","ar":"أعطيتُ نصيحة بسيطة. لا تحتاج آلات غالية أوّلاً، قلتُ. تحتاج الأمان."},"id":"L006"},{"actor":"maher","start":42.102,"text":{"en":"First, the owner bought safety gear for the team and a good set of axle stands.","ar":"أوّلاً، اشترى صاحب الورشة معدّات وقاية للفريق وطقماً جيّداً من حوامل المحور."},"id":"L007"},{"actor":"maher","start":47.516,"text":{"en":"Then he cleaned the workshop and put up a tool board. Next, he trained his mechanics in the five safety rules.","ar":"ثمّ نظّف الورشة وركّب لوحة عُدّة. بعد ذلك، درّب ميكانيكيّيه على قواعد الأمان الخمس."},"id":"L008"},{"actor":"maher","start":55.33,"text":{"en":"After six months, the garage passed the safety check and became an authorised service centre. The owner was proud.","ar":"بعد ستّة أشهر، نجحت الورشة في فحص الأمان وأصبحت مركز خدمة معتمداً. وكان صاحبها فخوراً."},"id":"L009"},{"actor":"maher","start":63.6,"text":{"en":"Now, he said, customers trust us, and my team is safe.","ar":"الآن، قال، الزبائن يثقون بنا، وفريقي آمن."},"id":"L010"},{"actor":"tarek","start":68.318,"text":{"en":"What did Maher say the owner needed first?","ar":"ماذا قال ماهر إنّ صاحب الورشة يحتاجه أوّلاً؟"},"subHold":8.687,"id":"L011"},{"actor":"tarek","start":77.005,"text":{"en":"Safety, not expensive machines.","ar":"الأمان، لا الآلات الغالية."},"id":"L012"},{"actor":"tarek","start":80.739,"text":{"en":"What three things did the owner do?","ar":"أيّ ثلاثة أمور فعلها صاحب الورشة؟"},"subHold":7.747,"id":"L013"},{"actor":"tarek","start":88.486,"text":{"en":"He bought safety gear and axle stands, cleaned the workshop and put up a tool board, and trained the team.","ar":"اشترى معدّات وقاية وحوامل محور، ونظّف الورشة وركّب لوحة عُدّة، ودرّب الفريق."},"id":"L014"},{"actor":"tarek","start":95.868,"text":{"en":"What happened after six months?","ar":"ماذا حدث بعد ستّة أشهر؟"},"subHold":7.487,"id":"L015"},{"actor":"tarek","start":103.355,"text":{"en":"The garage passed the safety check and became an authorised service centre.","ar":"نجحت الورشة في فحص الأمان وأصبحت مركز خدمة معتمداً."},"id":"L016"},{"actor":"maher","start":108.553,"text":{"en":"Now your decision. A garage owner has some money to improve his workshop.","ar":"الآن قرارك. صاحب ورشة لديه بعض المال لتحسين ورشته."},"id":"L017"},{"actor":"maher","start":114.687,"text":{"en":"Should he first buy a new diagnostic machine, buy safety gear and axle stands and train the team, or paint the building?","ar":"هل يشتري أوّلاً آلة تشخيص جديدة، أم معدّات وقاية وحوامل محور ويدرّب الفريق، أم يدهن المبنى؟"},"subHold":14.864,"id":"L018"},{"actor":"maher","start":129.551,"text":{"en":"Buy safety gear and axle stands and train the team. Safety must come first.","ar":"يشتري معدّات وقاية وحوامل محور ويدرّب الفريق. الأمان يجب أن يأتي أوّلاً."},"id":"L019"}],"subtitles":{"enabled":true,"langs":"en,ar","show":null,"lang":{}},"badgePlacement":{"x":"0.016","y":"0.016","width":"0.205"},"audio":{"master":"audio.m4a","lines":[{"key":"7e857b71e44102e2","bytes":39600,"sha":"314c489b22d0a336","address":"lines/7e857b71e44102e2.mp3"},{"key":"d28746d379132ba4","bytes":52128,"sha":"a5b070cd008faf6a","address":"lines/d28746d379132ba4.mp3"},{"key":"8300e5c245b5db91","bytes":30096,"sha":"6c9e0a53131d0c8a","address":"lines/8300e5c245b5db91.mp3"},{"key":"4e95d7f716b55d60","bytes":34416,"sha":"64837d04a899943a","address":"lines/4e95d7f716b55d60.mp3"},{"key":"68765492c396d7ca","bytes":32976,"sha":"e50e4378d9c4b869","address":"lines/68765492c396d7ca.mp3"},{"key":"d4a64ec309556b33","bytes":48096,"sha":"62d91f8c842879f3","address":"lines/d4a64ec309556b33.mp3"},{"key":"9792ea2f07af6a71","bytes":30384,"sha":"98672080f74b7e34","address":"lines/9792ea2f07af6a71.mp3"},{"key":"e2eb8663a4fb19a9","bytes":44784,"sha":"a1773c0d3092f341","address":"lines/e2eb8663a4fb19a9.mp3"},{"key":"500eaf05a9575981","bytes":47520,"sha":"a1a3d244f043a27a","address":"lines/500eaf05a9575981.mp3"},{"key":"0b42260bb8e8e3a2","bytes":26208,"sha":"90ca3eb70e430b0c","address":"lines/0b42260bb8e8e3a2.mp3"},{"key":"550983740bc32e39","bytes":19296,"sha":"60cd6f5ef6651977","address":"lines/550983740bc32e39.mp3"},{"key":"f82af65d291066ca","bytes":20304,"sha":"8143801ac65c0763","address":"lines/f82af65d291066ca.mp3"},{"key":"1202c1589c73ca6f","bytes":16128,"sha":"a48125c223344ce1","address":"lines/1202c1589c73ca6f.mp3"},{"key":"faa44bd9f62fe878","bytes":42192,"sha":"cab43894b358103f","address":"lines/faa44bd9f62fe878.mp3"},{"key":"2ac8a3c8beaa5a5d","bytes":15984,"sha":"5bf2f96c4ac46015","address":"lines/2ac8a3c8beaa5a5d.mp3"},{"key":"7629d76f49e3b81f","bytes":29088,"sha":"fcc286812230ff36","address":"lines/7629d76f49e3b81f.mp3"},{"key":"2a3c76d757b938b7","bytes":34704,"sha":"f820498b8ddf7121","address":"lines/2a3c76d7